WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.168
- I was thinking about why 
I was so fortunate

00:00:03.168 --> 00:00:05.968
to have a, such a great 
life and be so happy

00:00:05.968 --> 00:00:07.757
and what was making that happen.

00:00:07.757 --> 00:00:09.047
And I came to a conclusion

00:00:09.047 --> 00:00:12.178
that it comes 
down to the B-P-P

00:00:12.178 --> 00:00:14.237
which is my Big Picture Patch.

00:00:14.237 --> 00:00:16.237
Listen, I've got a 
lot of stresses

00:00:16.237 --> 00:00:17.607
and a lot of things 
going on in my life

00:00:17.607 --> 00:00:18.397
like anybody else.

00:00:18.397 --> 00:00:19.997
We all have headaches and 
there's so many things

00:00:19.997 --> 00:00:21.067
going on in the world and

00:00:21.067 --> 00:00:22.628
so many things to worry about.

00:00:22.628 --> 00:00:24.322
And I think a lot 
of its genetics and,

00:00:24.322 --> 00:00:26.297
obviously, probably at 
the end of the day

00:00:26.297 --> 00:00:29.078
the biggest factor in my
overall happiness in life has

00:00:29.078 --> 00:00:30.758
to come down to my parents.

00:00:30.758 --> 00:00:33.198
What that means is that 
no matter what's going on

00:00:33.198 --> 00:00:34.989
you always have to 
look at the big picture.

00:00:34.989 --> 00:00:37.086
And the big picture is 
the health and happiness

00:00:37.086 --> 00:00:39.268
of the closest five to ten 
people in your life.

00:00:39.268 --> 00:00:41.719
And I have that and no 
matter being on television

00:00:41.719 --> 00:00:43.348
or being really sad,

00:00:43.348 --> 00:00:45.578
when I think about that 
that's all I really care about.

00:00:45.578 --> 00:00:48.009
And by only caring 
about the big picture

00:00:48.009 --> 00:00:49.628
it helps me live my life.

00:00:49.628 --> 00:00:52.030
(light music)

